that you scored 38 points seven rebounds how do you feel today i feel a lot better you know i've

00:01:05.830 --> 00:01:10.540
been i've been laid up for the last couple days and uh you know i'm just happy that i can participate

00:01:10.540 --> 00:01:14.940
yesterday i was feeling really bad i didn't think i'd be able to play today but i got some

00:01:14.940 --> 00:01:19.120
antibiotics and today i feel a lot better all right there's been a lot of talk about this being your

00:01:19.120 --> 00:01:24.300
last all-star game how do you feel about that it very well can be i think uh you know right now

00:01:24.300 --> 00:01:28.180
in chicago they're looking to make a change and go a different direction with the coaching staff

00:01:28.180 --> 00:01:29.980
which I think affects me.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:34.520
