00:01:39.520 --> 00:01:40.960
in my mind, I'm thinking that's it.

00:01:41.120 --> 00:01:45.080
Well, one of the things that you tell me is that you really want to play another year.

00:01:45.260 --> 00:01:49.620
I would love to play, as long as everything's intact. I mean, to ask me to start all over

00:01:49.620 --> 00:01:54.350
with the coach, with the new philosophy, a whole new system, with an unknown situation,

00:01:54.470 --> 00:01:59.120
